      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-30T17:46:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Previously we knew that the Aeon men existed, but we did not know their significance. We now know that they are part of a force that fights for the ultimate Villian. Looking back through the cards it turns out that the Visionary has fought the Aeon Men before as can be clearly seen in the art for Cerebral Hemorrhage. Based on the fact that she teleported away during a pitch battle with a Scion it is clear that she knows something about the ultimate challenge that the other heroes do not. Where was she going? Is she linked to OblivAeon in some other way from some other time? Any theories from those more versed in Sentinels lore than me?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:20.606Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
