      "raw": "<p>Ah, right, thanks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Well, I suppose it depends on whether Dark Visionary teleported away because she knew somethign about OblivAeon, such has from her time traveling shenaningans (after all, she traveld time in the first place, and picked up Dark Visionary along the way), or she simply left for self-preservation reasons.&nbsp;</p>",
