      "id": 157800,
      "name": "Blossercubbles",
      "username": "Blossercubbles",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-30T22:50:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The simplest answer is just that Dark Visionary left because her greatest tool for success (Legacy) was defeated. Dark Visionary is a rather cruel mistress, willing to go pretty far to get done what needs to be done. I'd guess that if her mission of the moment seems impossible through whatever means, she'd leave it for later, under different and better circumstances, the other heroes be damned.</p>",
