      "created_at": "2016-01-30T23:26:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>Dark Visionary's Bio states \"</span><span>Dark Visionary fights alongside the Sentinels of the Multiverse… for now…\" a</span><span>nd the original Visionary's Bio tells us \"</span><span>An inter-dimensional hitchhiker, another version of Vanessa who had made very, very different choices, now occupies a corner of her psyche\"</span></p><p><span>In the image from the ARG called Scion's Aid the original Visionary is depicted instead of Dark Visionary. &nbsp;My thought is in between when Dark Visionary teleported &nbsp;away and the discussion with the Scion, Dark Visionary turned against the heros and the event from her tactics bio where \"</span><span>she was aided in clearing this dark aspect from her psyche, leaving her drained, but in complete control\" occured. &nbsp;Of course, I'm making a lot of assumptions so this could be dead wrong.</span></p>",
